**
!VERSION
!services/singverse-go-backend/go.mod
!services/singverse-go-backend/go.sum
!services/singverse-go-backend/cmd/**
!services/singverse-go-backend/internal/**
services/singverse-go-backend/bin/
services/singverse-go-backend/internal/web/dist/
!services/singverse-frontend/package.json
